# Line endings: LF everywhere (D147). Every blob is LF and every checkout writes LF, whatever the
# machine's core.autocrlf (the eol attribute overrides it): the Write tool, Git Bash sed, Python and
# heredocs then all agree with the files on disk. VC6 compiles LF sources to the same bytes (tested
# 2026-10-29: a full verify, 12,541 pairs unchanged). tools/eol.py finds and fixes a working file a
# Windows tool wrote with CRLF.
* text=auto eol=lf

# cmd.exe needs CRLF (none tracked yet)
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf

# generated from the client's strings, which hold lone CRs: stored byte for byte
docs/data/asserts.txt -text
